# The local model nao chats with: qwen3:14b with a 32K context window.
# Ollama's default window is 4,096 tokens and it silently drops the start of a
# longer prompt. nao's prompt (instructions, tool definitions, context) is
# ~11K tokens, so at the default the model never saw its instructions or the
# real table names. 32K costs ~2.7 GB of KV cache (q8_0), ~12 GB loaded in all.
# Build with `task nao:model`.
FROM qwen3:14b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
